(text "Inductor, rectifier, output capacitor (lines 52, 53)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 142.24 34.29 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e8399e62-6519-55ca-9c63-a29efaad9c73"))
(text_box "Notes\n1. Function: TPS61160 boost LED driver from VSYS_LV_BL, 60.2 mA (RSET 3.32 Ω, VFB 200 mV); strings\n   up to 22 V; open-LED threshold 25-27 V at SW keeps BL_LEDA below 30 V (SLVS791E §6.5).\n2. Absent state: CTRL low (SoC pull-down): off; an open string is bounded by the threshold.\n3. COMP 220 nF as the datasheet's typical application (SLVS791E Figure 15); inductor 22 µH\n   LQH3NPN220MMEL (Murata sheet not retrieved, rating UNVERIFIED); PMEG6010CEH rectifier.\n4. Software: pwm-backlight on CTRL (PWM 5-100 kHz, SLVS791E §6.3)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 142.24 0) (size 129.54 19.05) (margins 1.905 1.905 1.905 1.905) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "154007a4-402e-55c1-902a-253650c4f2c6"))
